      "kind": "figure",
      "character_canonical": "titus-oneil",
      "manufacturer": "mattel",
      "product_line": "elite-royal-rumble",
      "year": 2021,
      "character_variant": null,
      "condition": null
     }
    },
    {
     "quote_id": "f_q4",
     "source_id": "f_s1",
     "text": "Naturally, his trademark whistle is included. He's also got a cloth T-shirt of his saving face Rumble, Stumble, Slide catchphrase. He also has a pair of gripping hands.",
     "scope": {
      "kind": "figure",
      "character_canonical": "titus-oneil",
      "manufacturer": "mattel",
      "product_line": "elite-royal-rumble",
      "year": 2021,
      "character_variant": null,
      "condition": null
     }
    },
    {
     "quote_id": "f_q5",
     "source_id": "f_s1",
     "text": "I got him for $17 although I've seen him as cheap as $8 during the Christmas holiday.",
     "scope": {
      "kind": "figure",
      "character_canonical": "titus-oneil",
      "manufacturer": "mattel",
      "product_line": "elite-royal-rumble",
      "year": 2021,
      "character_variant": null,
      "condition": "loose"
     }
    },
    {
     "quote_id": "f_q6",
     "source_id": "f_s1",
     "text": "Titus O'Neil has: neck, bicep, ball-jointed shoulders, elbows, wrists, wrist hinge, torso, waist, hips, thighs, knees (double-jointed), ankles",
     "scope": {
      "kind": "figure",
      "character_canonical": "titus-oneil",
      "manufacturer": "mattel",
